{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">反演</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Möbius 反演"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个环</span> $k$. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/严格1-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">满足如下有限性条件</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对任意态射</span> $f$, <span lang=\"zh\">至多存在有限组态射</span> $(g,h)$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f=gh$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的态射集上的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">有限支集</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或者不要求有限支集</span>) $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">值函数空间</span> $\\operatorname{Fun}(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有卷积</span>\n$$\r\n(\\varphi * \\psi)(f) = \\sum_{f=gh} \\varphi(g) \\psi(h).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这样得到的代数称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">范畴代数</span></strong> $k\\mathcal{C}$, <span lang=\"zh\">它是群代数以及</span> incidence algebra (<span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/AndrewKobinZeta","text":"Andrew Kobin"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">用另一种视角</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有限支集的函数</span> $\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C) \\to k$ <span lang=\"zh\">相当于以</span> $\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为基的自由</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的元素</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时卷积等同于</span>\n$$\r\n\\sum a_g g * \\sum b_h h = \\sum a_g b_h gh.\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">其中若</span> $g,h$ <span lang=\"zh\">不能复合则</span> $gh=0$.)</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">等价的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴不一定给出同构的代数</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">所以范畴代数的概念的确是对</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">而不是</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">定义的概念</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">但是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如果进一步取范畴代数的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">得到的概念又尊重范畴的等价</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">即对于范畴等价</span> $\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">不一定有</span> $k\\mathcal C\\simeq k\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">但</span> $k\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $k\\mathcal D$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴代数的构造不是到代数的范畴的函子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">注意到函子</span> $\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出线性映射</span> $k\\mathcal C\\to k\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">但它不一定保持乘法</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">而是到</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita范畴","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">单位元</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\n\\delta(f) = \\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; f=\\mathrm{id}_c\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; \\text{其它},\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">是卷积的单位元</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">逆元</span></h3>\n<p>(todo: <span lang=\"zh\">何时可逆</span>)</p>\n<h3>Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若将</span> $k\\mathcal{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为仅有一个对象的</span> $\\mathsf{Vect}_k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span>\n$$\r\n[\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Vect}_k]\\simeq [k\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Vect}_k].\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $\\mathcal C$ (<span lang=\"zh\">生成的</span>$\\mathsf{Vect}_k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $k\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">在充实范畴的意义下</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}